# CSMF-MRS keeps one environment file per application, where each
# framework expects it (same convention as PRJ-itsms). Copy each example
# to the same name without ".example" and fill in real values. Never
# commit the real files.
#
#   src/api/.env.example  -> src/api/.env   Laravel API (database, session, CORS)
#   src/web/.env.example  -> src/web/.env   Nuxt web app (API base URLs; optional)
#
# This file intentionally defines no variables.
